WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.992 --> 00:00:06.693
WHAT'S THE LAST THING YOU'D

00:00:06.694 --> 00:00:09.362
EXPECT KIM KARDASHIAN TO REVEAL?

00:00:09.363 --> 00:00:11.932
THAT SHE'S STUDYING TO BECOME A

00:00:11.933 --> 00:00:12.666
LAWYER.

00:00:12.667 --> 00:00:14.434
THAT'S RIGHT, KHLOE KARDASHIAN'S

00:00:14.435 --> 00:00:17.971
SISTER IS APPRENTICING AT A LAW

00:00:17.972 --> 00:00:19.906
FIRM, LIKELY CONTRIBUTED BY HER

00:00:19.907 --> 00:00:22.876
ADVISEMENT OF THE 63-YEAR-OLD

00:00:22.877 --> 00:00:25.011
WOMAN JAILED FOR YEARS ON

00:00:25.012 --> 00:00:27.547
NON-VIOLENT CHARGES.

00:00:27.548 --> 00:00:28.615
WHY NOT?

00:00:28.616 --> 00:00:30.150
IF THIS PERSON CAN BECOME A

00:00:30.151 --> 00:00:31.151
LAWYER, AND THIS PERSON CAN

00:00:31.152 --> 00:00:33.053
BECOME A LAWYER, AND THIS PERSON

00:00:33.054 --> 00:00:35.689
CAN BECOME A LAWYER, AND I SAY

00:00:35.690 --> 00:00:38.725
PERSON LOOSELY, WHY CAN'T KIM?

00:00:38.726 --> 00:00:41.728
SHE'S GOT MORE SENSE THAN ALL OF

00:00:41.729 --> 00:00:43.897
THEM COMBINED.

00:00:43.898 --> 00:00:47.033
AVENATTI JUST GOT HIS $5 MILLION

00:00:47.034 --> 00:00:48.969
JET CONFISCATED.

00:00:48.970 --> 00:00:50.136
WHAT DOES THAT TELL YOU?

00:00:50.137 --> 00:00:51.705
LAWYERS GET AWAY WITH EVERYTHING

00:00:51.706 --> 00:00:53.640
BECAUSE THEY KNOW HOW TO GET

00:00:53.641 --> 00:00:56.943
AROUND EVERYTHING.

00:00:56.944 --> 00:00:57.677
AVENATTI ONLY GOT CAUGHT BECAUSE

00:00:57.678 --> 00:01:03.717
THE MEDIA'S ROACH MOTEL DREW HIM

00:01:03.718 --> 00:01:05.252
OUT OF THE NOOX AN

00:01:05.253 --> 00:01:05.285
OUT OF THE NOOKSAN

00:01:05.286 --> 00:01:05.885
OUT OF THE NOOKS AND CRANNIES

00:01:05.886 --> 00:01:08.121
WHERE HE DID HIS DIRTY WORK.

00:01:08.122 --> 00:01:09.456
WE SHOULD ALL BECOME LAWYERS.

00:01:09.457 --> 00:01:11.591
BECAUSE IF YOU LOOK AT LIFE,

00:01:11.592 --> 00:01:13.326
IT'S BASICALLY A GAME OF

00:01:13.327 --> 00:01:14.728
MONOPOLY AND LAWYERS ARE THE

00:01:14.729 --> 00:01:16.029
PEOPLE WHO WRITE THE

00:01:16.030 --> 00:01:16.796
INSTRUCTIONS AND ACTUALLY TAKE A

00:01:16.797 --> 00:01:18.865
FEW MINUTES TO READ THEM.

00:01:18.866 --> 00:01:20.967
WITHOUT A LAW DEGREE, WE'RE JUST

00:01:20.968 --> 00:01:21.668
SAPS.

00:01:21.669 --> 00:01:23.670
INSTEAD OF KNOCKING KIM FOR

00:01:23.671 --> 00:01:25.005
BRINGING A LITTLE BOOM-BOOM TO

00:01:25.006 --> 00:01:26.373
THE COURTROOM, WE SHOULD FOLLOW

00:01:26.374 --> 00:01:28.742
HER LEAD AND LET HER REST HER

00:01:28.743 --> 00:01:30.310
CASE WHEREVER SHE WANTS.

00:01:30.311 --> 00:01:32.078
EMILY, YOU CLAIM TO BE A LAWYER.

00:01:32.079 --> 00:01:33.880
I DON'T DOUBT IT FOR ONE SECOND.

00:01:33.881 --> 00:01:35.315
YOU TALK LIKE A LAWYER.

00:01:35.316 --> 00:01:36.316
VERY FAST.

00:01:36.317 --> 00:01:37.817
YOU READ EVERYTHING, THE SMALL

00:01:37.818 --> 00:01:38.118
PRINT.

00:01:38.119 --> 00:01:40.253
YOU KNOW WHAT'S GOING ON IN THIS

00:01:40.254 --> 00:01:40.553
WORLD.

00:01:40.554 --> 00:01:41.955
I'M SCARED OF YOU.

00:01:41.956 --> 00:01:42.689
&gt;&gt; OKAY.

00:01:42.690 --> 00:01:43.323
ON THIS --

00:01:43.324 --> 00:01:46.793
&gt;&gt; THAT WASN'T A QUESTION.

00:01:46.794 --> 00:01:47.227
[ LAUGHTER ]

00:01:47.228 --> 00:01:50.063
&gt;&gt; I THINK WHAT STRUCK ME ABOUT

00:01:50.064 --> 00:01:50.797
HER REASONING FOR THIS -- AND

00:01:50.798 --> 00:01:52.899
FIRST OF ALL, SHE'S NOT GOING TO

00:01:52.900 --> 00:01:53.366
LAW SCHOOL.

00:01:53.367 --> 00:01:56.436
SHE'S UNDERTAKING A FOUR-YEAR

00:01:56.437 --> 00:01:58.805
APPRENTICESHIP WITH THE LAW

00:01:58.806 --> 00:01:59.105
FIRM.

00:01:59.106 --> 00:02:02.542
SHE TAKES A MINI BAR EXAM.

00:02:02.543 --> 00:02:05.478
IF SHE PASSES, SHE'S ALLOWED TO

00:02:05.479 --> 00:02:05.845
CONTINUE.

00:02:05.846 --> 00:02:07.380
HER STATEMENT, IF I KNEW MORE, I

00:02:07.381 --> 00:02:08.281
COULD DO MORE.

00:02:08.282 --> 00:02:10.583
&gt;&gt; IF I KNEW MORE, I COULD DO

00:02:10.584 --> 00:02:10.884
MORE?

00:02:10.885 --> 00:02:11.918
THAT IS HER STATEMENT?

00:02:11.919 --> 00:02:15.055
&gt;&gt; I WONDER HOWEVER IF BEING AN

00:02:15.056 --> 00:02:16.990
ATTORNEY IS THAT.

00:02:16.991 --> 00:02:18.191
I THINK SOMEBODY WITH MILLIONS

00:02:18.192 --> 00:02:20.126
OF FOLLOWERS WHO IS LITERALLY

00:02:20.127 --> 00:02:21.194
THE INFLUENCER OF THE CENTURY

00:02:21.195 --> 00:02:23.830
FOR EVERYONE ELSE, YOU KNOW, BUT

00:02:23.831 --> 00:02:25.665
PEOPLE AT THIS TABLE, THEN I

00:02:25.666 --> 00:02:27.000
THINK MAYBE SHE COULD DO MORE

00:02:27.001 --> 00:02:29.736
WITH HER ATTENTION RATHER --

00:02:29.737 --> 00:02:31.171
WERE ON THE ATTENTION ON HER.

00:02:31.172 --> 00:02:34.174
&gt;&gt; BUT IF SHE KNEW LESS, THEN

00:02:34.175 --> 00:02:35.108
SHE WOULD DRESS LESS.

00:02:35.109 --> 00:02:35.742
I DON'T KNOW.

00:02:35.743 --> 00:02:37.444
JUAN, THOUGHTS?

00:02:37.445 --> 00:02:38.378
&gt;&gt; IF SHE KNEW LESS, SHE WOULD

00:02:38.379 --> 00:02:43.416
DRESS LESS?

00:02:43.417 --> 00:02:44.984
I WOULD SAY SHE'S DISTRACTING IN

00:02:44.985 --> 00:02:46.720
THE COURTROOM.

00:02:46.721 --> 00:02:48.888
I -- THIS TO ME IS LIKE AMATEUR

00:02:48.889 --> 00:02:49.189
HOUR.

00:02:49.190 --> 00:02:52.125
SHE SAID SHE WAS IN -- I THINK

00:02:52.126 --> 00:02:55.195
IT WAS THE ROOSEVELT ROOM AT THE

00:02:55.196 --> 00:02:56.596
WHITE HOUSE WITH THE PRESIDENT,

00:02:56.597 --> 00:02:57.831
BOY, THESE PEOPLE ARE MAKING --

00:02:57.832 --> 00:02:59.466
I WANT TO KNOW MORE.

00:02:59.467 --> 00:03:01.334
TO ME, IT'S VERY JUVENILE.

00:03:01.335 --> 00:03:02.569
YOU KNOW WHAT, SHE'S GOING TO

00:03:02.570 --> 00:03:03.603
HAVE TO STICK IT THROUGH.

00:03:03.604 --> 00:03:05.772
AS YOU SAID, A FOUR-YEAR DEAL.

00:03:05.773 --> 00:03:06.873
YOU KNOW WHAT, LET'S LOOK AT THE

00:03:06.874 --> 00:03:07.474
POSITIVE SIDE.

00:03:07.475 --> 00:03:11.478
AS YOU SAID, EMILY, SHE'S VERY

00:03:11.479 --> 00:03:12.245
INFLUENTIAL WITH YOUNG PEOPLE

00:03:12.246 --> 00:03:15.915
WHO HOLD HER UP, WHO ADMIRE HER.

00:03:15.916 --> 00:03:17.384
CLEARLY SHE'S MORPHED INTO

00:03:17.385 --> 00:03:19.352
SOMEBODY WHO SAYS I WANT TO DO

00:03:19.353 --> 00:03:20.587
MORE WITH MY LIFE, I REALLY WANT

00:03:20.588 --> 00:03:22.722
TO HAVE IMPACT ON AMERICA AND

00:03:22.723 --> 00:03:24.224
THE CRIMINAL JUSTICE SYSTEM.

00:03:24.225 --> 00:03:24.624
GO, GIRL.

00:03:24.625 --> 00:03:25.392
YOU GOT IT.

00:03:25.393 --> 00:03:27.327
&gt;&gt; WHEN YOU'RE AROUND A GOOD

00:03:27.328 --> 00:03:28.294
LAWYER, IT'S A SUPER POWER.

00:03:28.295 --> 00:03:30.163
IT'S LIKE THEY HAVE ACCESS TO

00:03:30.164 --> 00:03:30.964
STUFF YOU DON'T.

00:03:30.965 --> 00:03:32.365
&gt;&gt; AND YOU'RE GOING TO NEED ONE.

00:03:32.366 --> 00:03:32.766
&gt;&gt; YES.

00:03:32.767 --> 00:03:34.901
&gt;&gt; YOU NEED A GOOD LAWYER IN

00:03:34.902 --> 00:03:36.102
YOUR LIFE.

00:03:36.103 --> 00:03:37.637
LAW SCHOOL I'VE HEARD IS LIKE

00:03:37.638 --> 00:03:38.671
TAKING THREE FOREIGN LANGUAGES

00:03:38.672 --> 00:03:41.074
AT THE SAME TIME.

00:03:41.075 --> 00:03:42.342
I WOULD ADD ONE THING.

00:03:42.343 --> 00:03:43.777
&gt;&gt; WHAT?

00:03:43.778 --> 00:03:45.779
&gt;&gt; IF SHE KNEW HOW, SHE WOULD

00:03:45.780 --> 00:03:46.379
HAVE MORE WOW.

00:03:46.380 --> 00:03:48.948
&gt;&gt; THAT'S PRETTY GOOD.

00:03:48.949 --> 00:03:50.750
JESSE, WOULDN'T THE SOLUTION BE

00:03:50.751 --> 00:03:52.819
TO TEACH LAW IN GRADE SCHOOL?

00:03:52.820 --> 00:03:54.721
&gt;&gt; I CAN'T GET OVER HER

00:03:54.722 --> 00:03:55.088
STATEMENT.

00:03:55.089 --> 00:03:55.488
[ LAUGHTER ]

00:03:55.489 --> 00:04:00.593
IF I KNEW MORE, I WOULD DO MORE?

00:04:00.594 --> 00:04:04.597
&gt;&gt; SHE'S TRYING.

00:04:04.598 --> 00:04:07.634
YOU THINK KNOWING MORE IS

00:04:07.635 --> 00:04:08.034
OVERRATED.

00:04:08.035 --> 00:04:09.068
&gt;&gt; NO.

00:04:09.069 --> 00:04:09.502
[ LAUGHTER ]

00:04:09.503 --> 00:04:14.174
&gt;&gt; MY FAVORITE IS WHEN JESSE

00:04:14.175 --> 00:04:14.774
GETS TEARS IN HIS EYES.

00:04:14.775 --> 00:04:18.946
&gt;&gt; WHAT'S HER HOURLY RATE?

